      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Abhishek, I noticed that we never call `abort()` to the futures and I guess we may just remove them.\n\nThe futures are also not helpful to the bug this CL attempts to address - Aborting the listening task doesn\u0027t clean up the resource correctly and the UUID would still be there.",
