      "writtenOn": "2023-08-22T20:31:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think you need to refactor this further to remove listening joinhandles from this list. You still need to `abort` connecting joinhandles.\n\nMy suggestion:\n* Rename self.futures to `self.connecting` and only insert the connecting_task\n* Put the joinhandle for listening tasks in `self.listening` (as part of the InternalListeningSocket). Only if there is a joinhandle do we need to send the `Close` (which will end the future too).",
      "parentUuid": "4af5e56e_c23200aa",
      "revId": "44e0800776ccdf77b45d08d09721f2603444e348",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
